  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "*Before applying medicine<br />$\\frac{\\mathrm{dA}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\mathrm{K}[\\mathrm{A}]$ (First order growth) (Rate law)<br />$\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{\\mathrm{~A}_0}=\\frac{\\mathrm{N}}{\\mathrm{~N}_0}=\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{Kt}}$<br />*After applying medicine<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/GDO12DGIh_yPyx4hhM4QpLfQw_gOh8Wk0DMLEUUXVZ4.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />$\\mathrm{r}=-\\frac{\\mathrm{dA}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\mathrm{K}[\\mathrm{A}]^2 \\quad$ (Rate law)<br />$y=\\mathrm{Kx}^2$ Parabola",
    "image": null
  },
